3
00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:05.995
911. What's your emergency?

4
00:01:06.956 --> 00:01:08.117
Hello?

5
00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:12.252
This is 911. Go ahead.

6
00:01:13.413 --> 00:01:16.876
This is Suh Young-chul. who used to work at Chains Bio.

7
00:01:17.717 --> 00:01:22.011
Today at the Doongwoori Building I plan to run an experiment.

8
00:01:22.382 --> 00:01:25.094
Excuse me? Can you repeat that. please?

9
00:01:25.134 --> 00:01:27.427
Ah. not an experiment.

10
00:01:27.727 --> 00:01:29.138
It's closer to terrorism.

11
00:01:29.309 --> 00:01:30.140
What?

12
00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:35.145
That's right. A highly contagious bioterror attack.

13
00:01:38.818 --> 00:01:41.651
I tested the pathogen in my body.

14
00:01:48.198 --> 00:01:50.160
And it was a success.

15
00:01:51.581 --> 00:01:55.705
I am the only vaccine that can stop this outbreak.

16
00:01:59.169 --> 00:02:01.171
Organisms of the same species that.

17
00:02:01.211 --> 00:02:03.423
for a certain time. live in the same place

18
00:02:17.727 --> 00:02:19.319
Why are you waiting for me?

19
00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:23.483
You're 10 minutes late. What was it this time?

20
00:02:24.484 --> 00:02:25.785
It was nothing.

21
00:02:25.905 --> 00:02:26.656
Traffic was bad.

22
00:02:26.736 --> 00:02:29.078
so the taxi driver tried to let me off across the street.

23
00:02:29.539 --> 00:02:29.869
So ?

24
00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:33.243
Yeah. these things happen.

25
00:02:34.123 --> 00:02:37.377
It's okay if I say it. but how can he say that to me?

26
00:02:37.417 --> 00:02:38.498
So ?

27
00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:42.051
It's not what I wanted.

28
00:02:42.302 --> 00:02:44.003
I said. however long it takes.

29
00:02:44.053 --> 00:02:45.925
drop me off at the spot I chose.

30
00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:51.471
What?

31
00:02:52.262 --> 00:02:54.103
So it's my fault again?

32
00:02:54.354 --> 00:02:56.476
Welcome to the Chains Blo Conference.

33
00:02:56.476 --> 00:02:58.898
a leading platform for future technology.

34
00:02:58.938 --> 00:02:59.979
Thank you.

35
00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:02.362
You brought the invitation I gave you?

36
00:03:02.822 --> 00:03:05.775
...and now we'll hear from CEO Kang Woo-cheol.

37
00:03:05.825 --> 00:03:07.657
Please give him a round of applause.

38
00:03:13.743 --> 00:03:14.624
Is that the guy?

39
00:03:14.624 --> 00:03:17.247
The one I should grovel to if I want to work here?

40
00:03:18.418 --> 00:03:21.040
If only you got along with your dean.

41
00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:23.042
this wouldn't be necessary.

42
00:03:24.003 --> 00:03:26.426
Sure. my fault again.

43
00:03:27.347 --> 00:03:29.098
But don't you care how that dean

44
00:03:29.098 --> 00:03:30.760
treated his graduate students?

45
00:03:30.760 --> 00:03:32.182
No. I don't.

46
00:03:32.602 --> 00:03:35.054
Well. I'm sure he's a jerk.

47
00:03:35.305 --> 00:03:37.187
And you couldn't tolerate that.

48
00:03:37.857 --> 00:03:40.270
So you got on his bad side. and didn't get reappointed.

49
00:03:43.112 --> 00:03:45.114
I'm just curious...

50
00:03:45.615 --> 00:03:47.907
Why are you so fixated on your ex-wife's career

51
00:03:47.907 --> 00:03:49.279
10 years after the divorce?

52
00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:52.742
Because you have no friends.

53
00:03:53.493 --> 00:03:56.376
You keep doing things that make people hate you.

54
00:03:56.376 --> 00:03:58.828
Does your wife know you look after your ex-wife like this?

55
00:03:58.828 --> 00:04:02.382
My wife is not as sensitive as you are.

56
00:04:02.882 --> 00:04:04.964
She's probably even concerned for you.

57
00:04:05.675 --> 00:04:06.926
What a cool wife.

58
00:04:07.507 --> 00:04:10.260
You're a great match. I'm happy for you.

59
00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:13.012
If I say our company's main business

60
00:04:13.012 --> 00:04:15.014
is collective intelligence.

61
00:04:15.014 --> 00:04:16.516
people might wonder.

62
00:04:16.646 --> 00:04:18.057
"Why is a bio company.

63
00:04:18.057 --> 00:04:21.231
rather than an IT company. studying that topic?"

64
00:04:21.731 --> 00:04:24.404
Collective intelligence is a common term

65
00:04:24.404 --> 00:04:26.236
in the field of sociology.

66
00:04:26.406 --> 00:04:29.409
but the first person to use the term

67
00:04:29.569 --> 00:04:32.412
was an entomologist who studied ants.

68
00:04:32.452 --> 00:04:34.284
William Morton Wheeler.

69
00:04:34.574 --> 00:04:37.827
Collective intelligence is a key force driving evolution.

70
00:04:38.168 --> 00:04:41.331
You know the yellow slime mold 'Physarum polycephalum'?

71
00:04:41.751 --> 00:04:43.423
These fellows upgrade themselves

72
00:04:43.423 --> 00:04:44.924
through information exchange

73
00:04:44.924 --> 00:04:48.127
and optimize the direction of their growth towards food.

74
00:04:48.628 --> 00:04:50.630
Although not multicellular organisms.

75
00:04:50.630 --> 00:04:52.222
they can learn and remember.

76
00:04:52.682 --> 00:04:55.225
Inspired by these remarkable traits.

77
00:04:55.225 --> 00:04:56.976
we were able to dramatically improve

78
00:04:57.016 --> 00:04:59.058
the production of organic semiconductors.

79
00:04:59.479 --> 00:05:02.061
Let's give a hand to our little collaborators.

80
00:05:06.105 --> 00:05:08.608
This guy's more interesting than I expected.

81
00:05:08.858 --> 00:05:11.701
This isn't some lame company that makes copycat drugs.

82
00:05:11.821 --> 00:05:13.823
It's a serious. enterprising firm.

83
00:05:14.154 --> 00:05:15.655
After I introduced you.

84
00:05:15.655 --> 00:05:17.867
they even sent another invitation for you.

85
00:05:18.868 --> 00:05:21.000
Actually. that's why I came.

86
00:05:21.581 --> 00:05:24.294
I was curious what this message meant.

87
00:05:24.464 --> 00:05:26.376
To Prof. Kwon: Imperfect communication.

88
00:05:26.416 --> 00:05:27.667
the source of all tragedy

89
00:05:27.717 --> 00:05:31.010
...so this chip helps damaged nerves carry information.

90
00:05:31.171 --> 00:05:34.764
We injected it into a rat with severed spinal nerves

91
00:05:34.804 --> 00:05:36.556
and paralyzed hind legs.

92
00:05:37.136 --> 00:05:40.350
and as you can see. just a moment later.

93
00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:43.983
It was able to move no different from a healthy rat.

94
00:05:51.241 --> 00:05:53.243
If we continue with this research.

95
00:05:53.243 --> 00:05:55.575
and apply it to the human brain.

96
00:05:55.785 --> 00:05:58.908
I believe it may enable a direct transfer

97
00:05:58.948 --> 00:06:01.701
of information between individuals.

98
00:06:02.792 --> 00:06:04.123
When that happens.

99
00:06:04.504 --> 00:06:06.296
we may live in a world where

100
00:06:06.336 --> 00:06:09.509
you can't think bad thoughts in front of others.

101
00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:12.922
Thank you. CEO Kang.

102
00:06:13.092 --> 00:06:15.555
Please give him a round of applause!

103
00:06:23.102 --> 00:06:25.525
Next. to introduce Chains Bio's global market strategy...

104
00:06:32.862 --> 00:06:34.824
It's your first vacation in ages.

105
00:06:35.155 --> 00:06:38.698
So why spend it with the younger brother you see every day?

106
00:06:38.788 --> 00:06:43.042
This way I can get some fresh air. go shopping...

107
00:06:43.042 --> 00:06:45.455
You know how stifling it is working at a computer all day?

108
00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:54.093
Wow. look at all the camping stuff they have these days.

109
00:06:54.304 --> 00:06:55.885
I could just live outdoors.

110
00:06:57.136 --> 00:06:58.598
The clothes are nice. too.

111
00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:02.892
Should we go camping? On your next vacation?

112
00:07:03.563 --> 00:07:05.975
-The two of us? - Yeah. let's go.

113
00:07:06.266 --> 00:07:07.607
We'll grill some meat...

114
00:07:07.687 --> 00:07:09.359
That'd be great!

115
00:07:09.859 --> 00:07:11.481
We can go. why not?

116
00:07:11.481 --> 00:07:14.073
That's great. I'll buy some equipment. SECURITY

117
00:07:14.824 --> 00:07:17.197
You get back to work. Lunchtime will end soon.

118
00:07:17.197 --> 00:07:20.029
- No. I'll head back after you. - No need.

119
00:07:20.029 --> 00:07:22.742
The facilities here are great. So convenient.

120
00:07:23.453 --> 00:07:27.917
Don't I work my ass off so I can live in civilization?

121
00:07:27.917 --> 00:07:30.170
You always go on about civilization.

122
00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:32.091
why do you want to go camping?

123
00:07:32.091 --> 00:07:33.753
Camping is civilization. too.

124
00:07:33.963 --> 00:07:35.885
Go on. See you at home.

125
00:07:36.176 --> 00:07:37.717
I'll look around before going.

126
00:07:39.138 --> 00:07:39.759
Selamat tinggal.

127
00:07:39.759 --> 00:07:39.969
-Take care..- Yeah.

128
00:07:41.261 --> 00:07:41.511
Take care. Yeah.

129
00:07:45.225 --> 00:07:48.017
Hello. sir. I enjoyed your presentation.

130
00:07:48.148 --> 00:07:49.729
Oh. Professor Han.

131
00:07:49.939 --> 00:07:53.313
This is Professor Kwon Se-jeong. who I mentioned last time.

132
00:07:53.563 --> 00:07:55.114
Thank you for inviting me.

133
00:07:55.155 --> 00:07:57.737
And for this note on my invitation.

134
00:07:58.698 --> 00:07:59.949
Just a moment.

135
00:08:00.820 --> 00:08:01.871
Hello?

136
00:08:02.031 --> 00:08:03.122
Mr. Kang Woo-cheol?

137
00:08:03.623 --> 00:08:05.375
Yes. Who's speaking?

138
00:08:05.415 --> 00:08:08.168
I'm Lee Bong-seok. from the Seoul Counterterrorism Squad.

139
00:08:08.288 --> 00:08:09.579
How can I help you?

140
00:08:09.749 --> 00:08:11.461
You know a man named Suh Young-chul?

141
00:08:12.212 --> 00:08:14.884
This call seems important. Let's talk later.

142
00:08:14.884 --> 00:08:16.966
Ah. sure. We'll wait.

143
00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:22.642
You sure he's the one who sent this invitation?

144
00:08:22.682 --> 00:08:24.474
What are you doing? Go after him.

145
00:08:24.684 --> 00:08:25.185
What?

146
00:08:25.185 --> 00:08:26.976
Just hand him your card

147
00:08:27.016 --> 00:08:30.270
and say "I'm Kwon Se-jeong." that's all. .

148
00:08:38.528 --> 00:08:40.740
Why are you looking for Dr. Suh?

149
00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:41.991
We received a call

150
00:08:41.991 --> 00:08:44.284
that Dr. Suh is planning a terrorist attack

151
00:08:44.284 --> 00:08:46.496
in the building hosting your conference.

152
00:08:49.169 --> 00:08:51.171
I think I saw him today at the conference.

153
00:08:51.331 --> 00:08:52.332
Are you certain?

154
00:08:53.042 --> 00:08:54.424
Not 100% certain.

155
00:08:54.674 --> 00:08:56.176
He was standing too far away.

156
00:08:56.376 --> 00:08:58.758
Our team will arrive there soon.

157
00:08:58.758 --> 00:09:01.010
If you see him again. call me immediately at this number.

158
00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:02.382
All right. I will.

159
00:09:28.158 --> 00:09:29.829
Nice speech. Woo-cheol.

160
00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:31.541
So impressive.

161
00:09:32.412 --> 00:09:34.544
Information exchange through organic semiconductors?

162
00:09:35.375 --> 00:09:39.299
You know how hard I researched that.

163
00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:42.802
Consciousness in a multilateral network.

164
00:09:43.383 --> 00:09:46.226
Well. if that existed.

165
00:09:46.806 --> 00:09:49.849
no one would be betrayed and kicked out like me. right?

166
00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:51.561
You freak.

167
00:09:52.932 --> 00:09:56.276
The technology you researched can't be used anywhere.

168
00:09:57.777 --> 00:09:58.608
Bro.

169
00:09:59.399 --> 00:10:02.692
I'm taking humanity to the next level.

170
00:10:04.154 --> 00:10:06.656
Enabling a second cognitive revolution.

171
00:10:11.871 --> 00:10:13.042
You know what?

172
00:10:13.583 --> 00:10:14.754
You...

173
00:10:15.955 --> 00:10:17.707
are just a psycho.

174
00:10:18.258 --> 00:10:20.340
Get lost. you loser!

175
00:10:25.425 --> 00:10:27.217
But when you hired me.

176
00:10:27.677 --> 00:10:30.059
you said my research was great.

177
00:10:30.220 --> 00:10:32.312
That you respected my research.

178
00:10:33.353 --> 00:10:37.437
It was all just an act. so you could steal my research.

179
00:10:38.438 --> 00:10:40.190
And now... psycho?

180
00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:43.363
You stole research from that psycho.

181
00:10:44.734 --> 00:10:48.658
You just want to make humans go extinct. don't you?

182
00:10:49.619 --> 00:10:51.291
Not extinct.

183
00:10:51.411 --> 00:10:52.742
It's a birth.

184
00:10:53.163 --> 00:10:54.744
The birth of a new humanity.

185
00:10:55.165 --> 00:10:56.706
Just imagine it.

186
00:10:56.916 --> 00:10:59.379
Perfect communication will be possible.

187
00:10:59.669 --> 00:11:02.212
All the byproducts of crass individualism.

188
00:11:02.252 --> 00:11:04.214
jealousy. rivalry. suspicion...

189
00:11:05.885 --> 00:11:09.429
Those bizarre losses that arise from unstable communication.

190
00:11:09.759 --> 00:11:11.641
That's what I'm trying to stop.

191
00:11:15.145 --> 00:11:16.186
Wow!

192
00:11:19.519 --> 00:11:21.571
You crazy freak.

193
00:11:23.323 --> 00:11:24.404
Give it a try.

194
00:11:24.694 --> 00:11:26.115
It's got nothing to do with me.

195
00:11:26.526 --> 00:11:29.199
I'm clocking out. so good luck with that.

196
00:11:30.990 --> 00:11:35.375
I want you to be the link between me and the new humanity.

197
00:11:42.292 --> 00:11:43.383
What the hell are you doing?

198
00:11:43.713 --> 00:11:44.674
Research.

199
00:11:44.714 --> 00:11:46.045
You goddamned maniac!

200
00:12:28.007 --> 00:12:29.219
Hey. look at this.

201
00:12:29.679 --> 00:12:30.720
Hey mister!

202
00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:32.302
Shouldn't we call 911?

203
00:12:51.491 --> 00:12:52.492
Did you talk to him?

204
00:12:55.114 --> 00:12:56.456
Seemed like a bad time.

205
00:12:56.456 --> 00:12:58.458
Really? Just a sec.

206
00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:03.293
No. really. I don't think he'll want to talk now.

207
00:13:09.839 --> 00:13:12.302
Let's go eat. He'll call back.

208
00:13:24.944 --> 00:13:27.106
Police. Where's the conference hall?

209
00:13:27.237 --> 00:13:29.739
Turn left and go up the stairs. then...

210
00:13:34.744 --> 00:13:35.705
What is that?

211
00:13:39.709 --> 00:13:40.540
Go.

212
00:13:41.751 --> 00:13:43.253
Sir. are you okay?

213
00:13:49.339 --> 00:13:50.720
Call the containment team. - What?

214
00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:52.051
Call for a lockdown!

215
00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:01.731
Hi!

216
00:14:01.731 --> 00:14:04.234
Where are you. Daddy? What are you doing?

217
00:14:04.394 --> 00:14:06.065
I'll head home now.

218
00:14:06.186 --> 00:14:08.528
Honey. where's your passport?

219
00:14:08.648 --> 00:14:10.900
Should be in the drawer in the study.

220
00:14:12.031 --> 00:14:14.574
- You still with Professor Kwon? - Yeah.

221
00:14:14.574 --> 00:14:16.035
I'll head home soon.

222
00:14:16.536 --> 00:14:17.537
Want to say hi?

223
00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:23.002
Anyway. hurry home. We need to pack.

224
00:14:23.163 --> 00:14:23.873
Okay.

225
00:14:23.873 --> 00:14:26.506
Say bye to Dad. - Hurry home. Dad!

226
00:14:27.917 --> 00:14:29.419
Where are you going? Traveling?

227
00:14:33.513 --> 00:14:36.176
Why don't you answer? You immigrating or something?

228
00:14:36.716 --> 00:14:38.097
Well...

229
00:14:38.638 --> 00:14:41.181
A teaching position opened at UC Irvine...

230
00:14:41.431 --> 00:14:44.474
Really. you're going to the US? For how long?

231
00:14:45.225 --> 00:14:47.857
This time. we may just stay there.

232
00:14:54.824 --> 00:14:57.447
Ah. now I get it.

233
00:14:58.077 --> 00:15:00.119
You're leaving. so you wanted to set

234
00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:02.492
your ex-wife up with a job before going?

235
00:15:03.453 --> 00:15:04.704
Anyway. congrats.

236
00:15:04.834 --> 00:15:06.456
It's good news. right?

237
00:15:09.709 --> 00:15:12.131
Since it's the last time. let me ask.

238
00:15:13.423 --> 00:15:15.385
Why did you marry me?

239
00:15:18.968 --> 00:15:20.560
Well...

240
00:15:21.431 --> 00:15:24.974
The way you never back down when you think you're right...

241
00:15:24.974 --> 00:15:26.606
your personality?

242
00:15:26.766 --> 00:15:30.320
Wow. after you always begged me not to do that.

243
00:15:30.570 --> 00:15:31.941
You liked that?

244
00:15:33.363 --> 00:15:36.156
I did... I liked it.

245
00:15:37.157 --> 00:15:38.908
But I couldn't keep up with you.

246
00:15:39.279 --> 00:15:41.331
I couldn't handle it.

247
00:15:41.781 --> 00:15:44.534
I've always been a bit of a coward.

248
00:15:45.955 --> 00:15:48.168
That's why I broke up with you.

249
00:15:51.841 --> 00:15:54.544
Don't worry. I'll be okay.

250
00:15:55.675 --> 00:15:58.298
It's not like you. talking like that.

251
00:15:59.349 --> 00:16:00.680
I'm not saying you should change...

252
00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:01.761
Done eating?

253
00:16:02.101 --> 00:16:04.554
Let's go. your wife is waiting.

254
00:16:05.355 --> 00:16:07.016
There she goes again....

255
00:16:11.561 --> 00:16:12.562
Thank you.

256
00:16:14.364 --> 00:16:15.985
Have a good evening.

257
00:16:17.737 --> 00:16:18.988
Welcome.

258
00:16:19.199 --> 00:16:20.950
Shit. that's so funny. Yeah...

259
00:16:22.372 --> 00:16:23.913
Hey. I'll call you back.

260
00:16:24.123 --> 00:16:25.825
I'm gonna stuff my face.

261
00:16:26.246 --> 00:16:26.916
Yeah.

262
00:16:29.499 --> 00:16:31.291
Three people? - Yes. three.

263
00:16:31.461 --> 00:16:35.255
From here to here....we'll take it all.

264
00:16:35.755 --> 00:16:36.386
All of it?

265
00:16:36.756 --> 00:16:37.967
Yeah. all of it.

266
00:16:43.263 --> 00:16:45.265
You're paying today.

267
00:16:46.306 --> 00:16:46.936
Faham Got it?

268
00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:52.442
Damn it. So-eun!

269
00:16:53.273 --> 00:16:55.485
You should answer him. huh?

270
00:16:59.739 --> 00:17:01.861
The entire building is being locked down.

271
00:17:02.031 --> 00:17:04.744
Security personnel. evacuate everyone immediately!

272
00:17:06.075 --> 00:17:06.786
What's going on?

273
00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:11.501
Hey!

274
00:17:19.839 --> 00:17:20.630
Everyone evacuate!

275
00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:22.342
Move! Out of the way!

276
00:17:25.685 --> 00:17:28.728
Come out! Everyone move!

277
00:17:37.317 --> 00:17:39.399
Isn't the parking lot that way?

278
00:17:39.529 --> 00:17:40.610
Se-jeong.

279
00:17:42.572 --> 00:17:46.496
You should find at least one friend you can rely on.

280
00:17:52.081 --> 00:17:53.042
Everyone run!

281
00:17:53.463 --> 00:17:54.504
Run!

282
00:18:14.103 --> 00:18:15.145
Se-jeong!

283
00:18:15.605 --> 00:18:16.646
Damn it...

284
00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:31.541
Hurry!

285
00:18:58.728 --> 00:18:59.689
That way!

286
00:19:09.789 --> 00:19:11.080
Come quick! Hurry!

287
00:19:35.645 --> 00:19:37.897
Hyun-hee. are you hurt?

288
00:19:38.608 --> 00:19:40.400
I'm okay.

289
00:19:42.772 --> 00:19:44.364
What's going on?

290
00:19:45.825 --> 00:19:47.197
It's a terrorist attack.

291
00:19:48.077 --> 00:19:49.369
Who are you?

292
00:19:49.699 --> 00:19:50.910
I'm a policeman.

293
00:19:51.201 --> 00:19:53.203
We got a call that a bioterrorist attack

294
00:19:53.203 --> 00:19:54.994
would take place in this building.

295
00:19:55.285 --> 00:19:57.917
Those people seem to have been affected by the attack.

296
00:19:57.957 --> 00:19:59.379
What the hell?

297
00:20:25.485 --> 00:20:26.526
What the fuck?

298
00:20:48.798 --> 00:20:49.929
What the hell is this?

299
00:21:20.079 --> 00:21:22.212
What are those freaks doing?

300
00:21:28.087 --> 00:21:29.969
Turn off the light

301
00:22:11.971 --> 00:22:13.763
What about those students?

302
00:22:13.923 --> 00:22:15.635
Do something. you're a policeman!

303
00:22:15.725 --> 00:22:17.177
We're not safe here. either.

304
00:22:17.227 --> 00:22:18.848
Let's just wait for backup.

305
00:22:18.848 --> 00:22:20.430
So we're going to stand here

306
00:22:20.480 --> 00:22:22.642
and watch as those people get killed?

307
00:22:24.023 --> 00:22:25.064
Hyun-seok...

308
00:22:29.028 --> 00:22:32.532
It looks like they're going towards that sign.

309
00:22:32.822 --> 00:22:34.324
Huh? The sign?

310
00:22:41.751 --> 00:22:43.203
We can lure them with these.

311
00:22:44.294 --> 00:22:45.165
Those?

312
00:22:45.665 --> 00:22:47.417
What will you do with them?

313
00:22:48.548 --> 00:22:50.300
Use this. my wheelchair!

314
00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:52.962
What are you talking about?

315
00:22:52.962 --> 00:22:55.175
What'll you do without it?

316
00:22:55.345 --> 00:22:56.556
Didn't you see earlier?

317
00:22:57.016 --> 00:23:00.099
If I'm going to get out. I won't be able to do it on this.

318
00:23:01.561 --> 00:23:04.063
We can't just let those people die.

319
00:23:13.983 --> 00:23:15.445
Fuck!

320
00:23:44.854 --> 00:23:45.765
Hurry!

321
00:23:47.357 --> 00:23:48.318
What?

322
00:23:48.318 --> 00:23:49.769
I can't. There's no way.

323
00:23:52.692 --> 00:23:54.234
Hey. don't go out there!

324
00:24:00.950 --> 00:24:01.911
This way!

325
00:24:03.082 --> 00:24:04.123
Hurry!

326
00:24:14.174 --> 00:24:15.385
Shut up. will you?

327
00:24:15.465 --> 00:24:16.256
Hurry!

328
00:24:30.980 --> 00:24:32.021
Why'd she do that?

329
00:24:33.233 --> 00:24:34.524
I'll go get her.

330
00:24:47.787 --> 00:24:49.209
Come. let's go.

331
00:24:49.579 --> 00:24:50.880
Come with me.

332
00:24:50.880 --> 00:24:53.583
You can do it. Let's go.

333
00:24:53.793 --> 00:24:55.835
Take my hand and go.

334
00:24:56.176 --> 00:24:58.087
Let's go. hurry.

335
00:25:03.143 --> 00:25:04.144
Kyu-seong!

336
00:25:15.605 --> 00:25:17.607
Come here. asshole!

337
00:25:20.570 --> 00:25:22.452
Get in. hurry!

338
00:26:19.919 --> 00:26:21.801
If I say our company's main business

339
00:26:21.841 --> 00:26:23.473
is collective intelligence...

340
00:26:23.553 --> 00:26:24.974
"Why is a bio company.

341
00:26:25.014 --> 00:26:28.178
rather than an IT company. studying that topic?"

342
00:26:28.678 --> 00:26:30.350
These fellows upgrade themselves

343
00:26:30.390 --> 00:26:31.981
through information exchange.

344
00:26:35.315 --> 00:26:38.238
Collective intelligence is a key force driving evolution.

345
00:27:18.858 --> 00:27:20.029
Kyu-seong!

346
00:27:20.690 --> 00:27:21.821
Hurry!

347
00:27:25.365 --> 00:27:26.446
No!

348
00:28:05.575 --> 00:28:08.238
This afternoon. the Doongwoori Building

349
00:28:08.238 --> 00:28:11.911
was locked down following an act of bio-terrorism.

350
00:28:12.162 --> 00:28:15.455
Health authorities designated the location a terrorism zone.

351
00:28:15.585 --> 00:28:18.288
and a full quarantine is in effect until an investigation...

352
00:28:18.288 --> 00:28:19.919
The Counterterrorism HQ says

353
00:28:19.959 --> 00:28:22.502
the virus in question is highly contagious

354
00:28:22.712 --> 00:28:24.634
and spreads extremely quickly.

355
00:28:24.714 --> 00:28:27.507
The Disease Control Agency is devoting all its resources

356
00:28:27.597 --> 00:28:28.598
to obtaining

357
00:28:28.598 --> 00:28:29.889
and researching possible vaccines.

358
00:28:29.929 --> 00:28:31.261
Meanwhile. unconfirmed rumors

359
00:28:31.351 --> 00:28:32.802
about this bio-terrorism attack

360
00:28:32.852 --> 00:28:35.265
are rapidly spreading online.

361
00:28:35.475 --> 00:28:37.016
SWAT deployment complete.

362
00:28:37.016 --> 00:28:39.018
Double barricade of Doongwoori Building in place.

363
00:28:39.189 --> 00:28:40.400
Visual confirmation.

364
00:28:54.494 --> 00:28:56.326
Hello. shoppers.

365
00:28:56.666 --> 00:29:00.630
Thank you for visiting Doongwoori Shopping Mall today.

366
00:29:01.421 --> 00:29:04.544
The shopping mall is now closing.

367
00:29:05.295 --> 00:29:08.588
We look forward to welcoming you tomorrow

368
00:29:08.638 --> 00:29:10.720
with even better service.

369
00:29:11.511 --> 00:29:15.595
We wish you a comfortable and safe trip home.

370
00:29:15.845 --> 00:29:16.646
Thank you.

371
00:29:16.646 --> 00:29:18.768
Shit. the data's not working.

372
00:29:19.229 --> 00:29:20.850
I'm okay. Yeah.

373
00:29:22.192 --> 00:29:23.483
And you. Dad?

374
00:29:24.524 --> 00:29:26.446
My Dearest Daughter

375
00:29:27.157 --> 00:29:28.738
Really? Thank God...

376
00:29:34.033 --> 00:29:35.245
Dad!

377
00:29:36.616 --> 00:29:38.998
- Who are you? Where's my dad? - Did Dad answer?

378
00:29:40.420 --> 00:29:41.961
Ji-hye. go to Grandma for a sec.

379
00:29:42.372 --> 00:29:43.963
- Why? - Just for a sec.

380
00:29:44.043 --> 00:29:45.215
Mom. take her.

381
00:29:45.215 --> 00:29:47.217
Right. come with me for a minute.

382
00:29:53.473 --> 00:29:54.634
What...

383
00:29:57.016 --> 00:29:58.728
What about Kyu-seong?

384
00:30:02.312 --> 00:30:03.983
Did he go somewhere?

385
00:30:06.446 --> 00:30:07.777
Kyu-seong...

386
00:30:09.319 --> 00:30:12.322
saved some people. and then...

387
00:30:13.203 --> 00:30:14.364
Who...

388
00:30:14.954 --> 00:30:16.456
Who did he save?

389
00:30:16.906 --> 00:30:18.788
Everything just sucks!

390
00:30:19.118 --> 00:30:20.370
And then what?

391
00:30:21.000 --> 00:30:23.623
And then what happened?

392
00:30:31.221 --> 00:30:32.972
-Kyu-seong... - Dad!

393
00:30:41.100 --> 00:30:42.432
What are you talking about?

394
00:30:43.022 --> 00:30:45.395
You know how long I've been stuck here?

395
00:30:47.437 --> 00:30:50.150
You won't get infected unless you're bitten!

396
00:30:51.191 --> 00:30:52.362
What did you say?

397
00:30:55.745 --> 00:30:56.786
What's this?

398
00:30:57.076 --> 00:30:58.408
What do you think?

399
00:31:01.120 --> 00:31:02.452
You're going to carry me?

400
00:31:02.622 --> 00:31:04.254
Who else is going to carry you?

401
00:31:05.004 --> 00:31:06.796
Think of it as going camping.

402
00:31:07.126 --> 00:31:11.671
This is why you should think twice before helping others.

403
00:31:14.634 --> 00:31:16.095
Listen. Officer!

404
00:31:16.216 --> 00:31:18.558
There's a rescue team coming to get us. right?

405
00:31:20.720 --> 00:31:21.721
The rescue team

406
00:31:23.473 --> 00:31:24.684
can't come in here.

407
00:31:24.814 --> 00:31:25.605
What?

408
00:31:26.105 --> 00:31:27.567
What are you saying?

409
00:31:27.567 --> 00:31:29.149
We're all still alive!

410
00:31:29.319 --> 00:31:31.651
The news has reported that this virus

411
00:31:31.691 --> 00:31:33.443
is unbelievably contagious.

412
00:31:33.443 --> 00:31:35.655
Until an epidemiological analysis is done.

413
00:31:35.695 --> 00:31:37.537
this building is under quarantine.

414
00:31:37.617 --> 00:31:38.908
Then what about us?

415
00:31:38.908 --> 00:31:41.241
They're telling us to just die here?

416
00:31:41.331 --> 00:31:42.742
I don't wanna die...

417
00:31:42.742 --> 00:31:44.834
- I don't wanna die! - I'm going fucking crazy...

418
00:31:44.914 --> 00:31:47.497
Fuck. you know how much I pay this country in taxes?

419
00:31:47.497 --> 00:31:49.799
But they won't save me?

420
00:31:50.800 --> 00:31:54.754
There is one way that we can be saved.

421
00:31:55.134 --> 00:31:56.466
What's that?

422
00:31:56.556 --> 00:31:59.389
The man behind this attack. Suh Young-chul.

423
00:31:59.429 --> 00:32:01.851
says he's injected the vaccine into his own body.

424
00:32:01.931 --> 00:32:04.894
If we find him and bring him out. we can all be rescued.

425
00:32:05.014 --> 00:32:06.396
Where is he?

426
00:32:07.187 --> 00:32:10.440
It's said he attended the seminar in this building today.

427
00:32:10.650 --> 00:32:12.822
and there's no sign that he left.

428
00:32:13.863 --> 00:32:15.325
Suh Young-chul...

429
00:32:15.865 --> 00:32:18.528
came to meet Chains Bio CEO Kang Woo-cheol.

430
00:32:19.199 --> 00:32:20.029
That's right.

431
00:32:20.160 --> 00:32:20.910
How'd you know that?

432
00:32:20.910 --> 00:32:22.162
After the seminar.

433
00:32:22.202 --> 00:32:25.495
I saw him by Kang's VIP Room on the 3rd floor.

434
00:32:25.535 --> 00:32:27.667
You must be a professor.

435
00:32:27.787 --> 00:32:29.459
Then where did he go?

436
00:32:29.499 --> 00:32:32.792
I saw him follow Kang into the room.

437
00:32:33.002 --> 00:32:34.634
So what are we supposed to do?

438
00:32:34.964 --> 00:32:36.716
We can't even set foot outside this door!

439
00:32:36.716 --> 00:32:40.300
Go up to the 3rd floor? How can we make it there?

440
00:32:40.390 --> 00:32:41.511
Right...

441
00:32:42.051 --> 00:32:43.473
Those people out there

442
00:32:44.053 --> 00:32:46.856
seem to be evolving through information exchange.

443
00:32:47.227 --> 00:32:49.108
First they walked on all fours.

444
00:32:49.309 --> 00:32:51.020
and charged at signs.

445
00:32:51.651 --> 00:32:53.022
Now they walk on two feet

446
00:32:53.733 --> 00:32:55.775
and their ability to identify humans

447
00:32:55.775 --> 00:32:57.317
is slowly taking shape.

448
00:32:58.027 --> 00:32:59.819
They're exchanging info?

449
00:32:59.949 --> 00:33:02.162
How. by calling each other?

450
00:33:02.532 --> 00:33:04.664
Words are not the only way to communicate.

451
00:33:05.074 --> 00:33:06.376
Like fungi or mushrooms.

452
00:33:06.496 --> 00:33:07.877
many creatures other than humans

453
00:33:07.957 --> 00:33:09.579
have their own communication networks.

454
00:33:09.579 --> 00:33:13.333
For example. ants communicate by pheromones.

455
00:33:13.923 --> 00:33:16.045
And to expedite the exchange of pheromones.

456
00:33:16.135 --> 00:33:18.338
they create a communication network of mucus.

457
00:33:18.468 --> 00:33:22.011
So you're saying the infected people there.

458
00:33:22.432 --> 00:33:24.434
they're in a state resembling ants?

459
00:33:24.554 --> 00:33:26.686
If they have collective intelligence based

460
00:33:26.686 --> 00:33:27.977
on information exchange.

461
00:33:28.268 --> 00:33:30.810
perhaps we can input false information.

462
00:33:32.562 --> 00:33:34.774
What. they've turned into ants?

463
00:33:34.904 --> 00:33:37.947
So how do we give them false info?

464
00:33:38.488 --> 00:33:39.859
Show them fake news?

465
00:33:39.989 --> 00:33:42.202
Ants. too. often show errant behavior

466
00:33:42.242 --> 00:33:44.284
when receiving false information.

467
00:33:44.324 --> 00:33:46.916
For example. ant mills.

468
00:33:47.707 --> 00:33:49.499
Sometimes while exchanging pheromones.

469
00:33:49.709 --> 00:33:51.331
Ant Mill an error occurs.

470
00:33:51.461 --> 00:33:54.754
At such times. they form a giant circle in one spot

471
00:33:54.754 --> 00:33:57.927
and keep turning in place. unable to stop.

472
00:33:58.838 --> 00:34:00.180
Until they die.

473
00:34:00.470 --> 00:34:03.683
So how are we going to give them false information?

474
00:34:04.053 --> 00:34:08.017
If one of us went to them giving off a special odor.

475
00:34:08.308 --> 00:34:10.099
and the rest of us stood still.

476
00:34:10.099 --> 00:34:12.442
giving off a completely different odor.

477
00:34:12.602 --> 00:34:15.145
I don't think they'd be able to recognize us as humans.

478
00:34:15.735 --> 00:34:18.198
Then until they figure out their mistake.

479
00:34:18.528 --> 00:34:20.450
we can buy ourselves some time.

480
00:34:21.741 --> 00:34:23.703
Who's gonna do that?

481
00:34:24.154 --> 00:34:25.245
I'll do it.

482
00:34:26.156 --> 00:34:27.827
You'll fail. 100%.

483
00:34:28.458 --> 00:34:31.661
Look. how about someone more fit?

484
00:34:32.292 --> 00:34:33.753
This guy should do.

485
00:34:33.913 --> 00:34:35.044
I'll do it.

486
00:34:35.044 --> 00:34:36.716
I said I'll do it.

487
00:34:37.757 --> 00:34:39.879
You're looking down on me because of my age.

488
00:34:40.220 --> 00:34:41.671
But in my 20s. I won a gold medal

489
00:34:41.671 --> 00:34:43.553
in a national track and field competition.

490
00:34:43.553 --> 00:34:44.924
Yeah sure. you stay out.

491
00:34:46.306 --> 00:34:47.307
That hurts! Ouch!

492
00:34:50.099 --> 00:34:52.182
I coached track and field before retiring.

493
00:34:52.482 --> 00:34:55.855
Professor. tell me what I should do.

494
00:35:04.864 --> 00:35:06.576
Where should I put this?

495
00:35:06.576 --> 00:35:07.747
Here.

496
00:35:07.947 --> 00:35:09.289
- Here? - Yeah.

497
00:35:09.289 --> 00:35:11.871
I added you all to a group chat. so check it.

498
00:35:12.542 --> 00:35:16.166
If they're exchanging information. we should do it. too.

499
00:35:33.022 --> 00:35:35.435
Bring back this same perfume.

500
00:35:45.535 --> 00:35:48.037
Hey. you nutjobs!

501
00:35:48.618 --> 00:35:49.909
Come and get me!

502
00:37:13.993 --> 00:37:15.124
Hurry!

503
00:37:15.495 --> 00:37:17.126
Close the door!

504
00:37:18.788 --> 00:37:20.420
I got them. Here.

505
00:37:32.932 --> 00:37:33.052
Thal antifreeze. bring it here

506
00:37:33.052 --> 00:37:34.304
That antifreeze. bring it here!

507
00:37:34.304 --> 00:37:35.435
Antifreeze. okay!

508
00:37:40.150 --> 00:37:40.940
Here.

509
00:37:40.980 --> 00:37:42.061
That stinks!

510
00:37:42.192 --> 00:37:44.023
Why does this smell so strong?

511
00:38:04.424 --> 00:38:05.755
Ready? - Yeah.

512
00:40:15.885 --> 00:40:17.347
We can go now.

513
00:40:37.197 --> 00:40:37.987
Hurry up!

514
00:40:40.079 --> 00:40:41.281
Let's just go!

515
00:40:45.034 --> 00:40:46.166
What are you doing?

516
00:40:48.788 --> 00:40:50.630
Does anyone have a lighter?

517
00:41:20.740 --> 00:41:21.661
Hurry. run!

518
00:41:23.203 --> 00:41:24.324
Behind us!

519
00:41:45.765 --> 00:41:46.806
Run. quickly!

520
00:41:51.901 --> 00:41:52.942
Hold on tight.

521
00:42:13.293 --> 00:42:14.214
Look out!

522
00:42:52.832 --> 00:42:55.084
How did a world-renowned scientist

523
00:42:55.084 --> 00:42:57.797
become a terrorist threating the nation?

524
00:42:58.007 --> 00:43:01.010
Let's look into the background of Dr. Suh Young-chul.

525
00:43:01.130 --> 00:43:02.922
He was top-ranked at his university

526
00:43:02.972 --> 00:43:04.514
from entrance to graduation.

527
00:43:04.724 --> 00:43:08.017
and his graduation thesis "Biocomputing With Fungi"

528
00:43:08.178 --> 00:43:10.770
was published in the journal Science.

529
00:43:10.980 --> 00:43:13.395
For such a promising talent

530
00:43:13.395 --> 00:43:14.596
to suddenly commit terrorism

531
00:43:14.596 --> 00:43:15.797
and hold the nation hostage.

532
00:43:15.797 --> 00:43:17.842
it's quite hard to understand.

533
00:43:18.042 --> 00:43:18.886
Reporter Kim Seong-il.

534
00:43:18.886 --> 00:43:20.871
are there any notable details

535
00:43:20.871 --> 00:43:22.596
concerning Suh Young-chul ?

536
00:43:22.796 --> 00:43:26.296
Suh's father was a professor of Applied Biology

537
00:43:26.296 --> 00:43:28.568
at Seocheong University.

538
00:43:28.568 --> 00:43:29.701
PROF. SUH DENIES MISUSE OF RESEARCH FUNDS
While he was there.

539
00:43:29.701 --> 00:43:32.506
PROF. SUH DENIES MISUSE OF RESEARCH FUNDS
an anonymous tip led to an internal report

540
00:43:32.506 --> 00:43:34.873
on misuse of funds for his research lab

541
00:43:34.873 --> 00:43:36.917
and exploitation of student researchers.

542
00:43:36.917 --> 00:43:38.871
and this was widely covered in the press.

543
00:43:38.871 --> 00:43:41.041
Four weeks after the report

544
00:43:41.041 --> 00:43:43.719
Professor Suh chose to end his own life.

545
00:43:43.719 --> 00:43:45.995
Is there any link between this incident

546
00:43:45.995 --> 00:43:48.402
and Suh Young-chul's terrorist attack ?

547
00:43:48.602 --> 00:43:51.561
Could it be some sort of revenge?

548
00:43:51.891 --> 00:43:55.315
So far. Suh has not made any requests or demands.

549
00:43:55.355 --> 00:43:58.818
so it seems unlikely that the two incidents are related.

550
00:43:58.898 --> 00:44:01.441
At the moment. the government has not released

551
00:44:01.441 --> 00:44:03.323
any information about the attack.

552
00:44:05.405 --> 00:44:06.486
3rd Floor.

553
00:44:16.746 --> 00:44:17.747
No one here.

554
00:44:17.797 --> 00:44:18.628
Hurry!

555
00:44:47.907 --> 00:44:49.529
Suh Young-chul. you are under arrest

556
00:44:49.579 --> 00:44:51.741
for the Doongwoori Building terrorist attack.

557
00:44:51.991 --> 00:44:54.584
You have the right to an attorney.

558
00:44:54.584 --> 00:44:56.416
and the right to remain silent.

559
00:44:56.666 --> 00:44:59.629
Anything you say can and will be used against you in court...

560
00:44:59.629 --> 00:45:00.750
Nice to meet you.

561
00:45:01.171 --> 00:45:04.133
Using water to disrupt their communications network.

562
00:45:04.754 --> 00:45:06.636
that was your idea. Professor Kwon?

563
00:45:07.046 --> 00:45:07.797
What's this?

564
00:45:07.797 --> 00:45:09.219
You two know each other?

565
00:45:09.319 --> 00:45:10.510
But that was a mistake.

566
00:45:12.972 --> 00:45:15.014
Water evaporates quickly.

567
00:45:15.145 --> 00:45:17.897
If water mixes in the air with their network.

568
00:45:17.937 --> 00:45:19.269
won't it work faster?

569
00:45:19.939 --> 00:45:20.810
Forget it.

570
00:45:21.561 --> 00:45:22.652
What now?

571
00:45:23.153 --> 00:45:24.404
Is the rescue team coming?

572
00:45:25.064 --> 00:45:25.905
No.

573
00:45:26.276 --> 00:45:28.528
We have to meet the rescue team on the roof.

574
00:45:28.528 --> 00:45:29.028
What?

575
00:45:29.028 --> 00:45:31.161
The rescue team must not be exposed to the infected.

576
00:45:31.161 --> 00:45:34.954
We almost died coming here. now we have to go to the roof?

577
00:45:35.124 --> 00:45:38.077
Can't the rescue team come down and wipe them all out?

578
00:45:38.788 --> 00:45:40.290
Those people are patients.

579
00:45:40.630 --> 00:45:42.832
We've been ordered not to kill them without reason.

580
00:45:42.882 --> 00:45:44.464
What bullshit!

581
00:45:44.504 --> 00:45:46.176
Those monsters out there are patients?

582
00:45:46.676 --> 00:45:48.298
Do patients kill people?

583
00:45:49.429 --> 00:45:52.302
Damn it. I don't care if they're monsters or whatever.

584
00:45:52.512 --> 00:45:55.555
At any rate. if we can get him up to the roof.

585
00:45:55.685 --> 00:45:58.688
the rescue team will come. Then we can all survive.

586
00:45:58.898 --> 00:46:01.521
We just need to find a safe way to get there.

587
00:46:02.272 --> 00:46:03.943
Is there one?

588
00:46:04.103 --> 00:46:05.104
There is.

589
00:46:05.235 --> 00:46:08.988
There's a cargo elevator that most people don't know about.

590
00:46:10.530 --> 00:46:12.612
That seems safest.

591
00:46:13.283 --> 00:46:15.365
I think that security guard's right.

592
00:46:18.368 --> 00:46:21.080
Alright. let's give it a try.

593
00:46:21.461 --> 00:46:23.213
You take the lead.

594
00:46:27.217 --> 00:46:28.508
Let's go.

595
00:46:30.470 --> 00:46:31.511
You first.

596
00:46:36.306 --> 00:46:37.387
Professor Gong!

597
00:46:41.601 --> 00:46:44.234
You got here quickly.

598
00:46:44.394 --> 00:46:45.235
Yes.

599
00:46:46.606 --> 00:46:48.488
This was Suh Young-chul's research lab?

600
00:46:48.488 --> 00:46:49.149
Yeah.

601
00:46:49.319 --> 00:46:54.244
After leaving Chains Bio. it seems he kept researching here.

602
00:46:54.614 --> 00:46:55.575
Professor Joo!

603
00:46:55.655 --> 00:46:56.536
Yeah.

604
00:46:57.207 --> 00:47:00.250
Say hello. This is Myunghan University Biotechnology

605
00:47:00.290 --> 00:47:01.711
Professor Gong Sul-hee.

606
00:47:02.542 --> 00:47:05.124
These are professors Lee Hyeon-myeong and Jo Hyeon-mi.

607
00:47:05.124 --> 00:47:07.086
So the government has assembled

608
00:47:07.126 --> 00:47:09.169
this special investigative team.

609
00:47:09.169 --> 00:47:11.921
When the SWAT team goes in. we'll join them.

610
00:47:12.172 --> 00:47:13.803
so prepare yourself. Professor Gong.

611
00:47:13.803 --> 00:47:15.054
Understood.

612
00:47:15.805 --> 00:47:17.427
Alpha Team take the front door.

613
00:47:17.477 --> 00:47:19.179
Delta Team enter from the back.

614
00:47:36.616 --> 00:47:37.657
Shit...

615
00:47:38.328 --> 00:47:39.699
I'm gonna do it.

616
00:47:39.949 --> 00:47:41.161
I'm pushing it.

617
00:47:51.921 --> 00:47:53.263
Hurry up!

618
00:47:54.174 --> 00:47:55.385
Hurry!

619
00:47:56.386 --> 00:47:57.847
Close the door. quick!

620
00:48:03.393 --> 00:48:04.774
Going up.

621
00:48:07.066 --> 00:48:09.479
We'll be on the roof in 5 minutes.

622
00:48:12.782 --> 00:48:14.324
How old are you?

623
00:48:15.235 --> 00:48:17.157
You're in great shape for your age.

624
00:48:18.288 --> 00:48:20.240
The way you slid back there was so cool.

625
00:48:21.161 --> 00:48:22.622
You were so fast.

626
00:48:23.333 --> 00:48:24.204
Like this.

627
00:48:27.547 --> 00:48:28.458
The doors are opening.

628
00:48:46.266 --> 00:48:47.066
No!

629
00:49:11.461 --> 00:49:12.842
He got away!

630
00:49:14.294 --> 00:49:15.845
Who cares if he did?

631
00:49:16.346 --> 00:49:19.469
You really think that bastard's more important than us?

632
00:49:19.469 --> 00:49:21.181
That jerk is the vaccine.

633
00:49:21.391 --> 00:49:24.604
You saw it now. The infected didn't even touch him.

634
00:49:24.804 --> 00:49:26.686
We need to take that vaccine out with us!

635
00:49:26.806 --> 00:49:27.977
But...

636
00:49:28.558 --> 00:49:30.560
How are we supposed to bring him out?

637
00:49:30.560 --> 00:49:34.154
You saw how those monsters are swarming all over!

638
00:49:34.694 --> 00:49:37.157
How do we pull him out of there?

639
00:49:38.117 --> 00:49:39.199
The doors are opening.

640
00:49:48.958 --> 00:49:52.502
What? Are those bastards mimicking us?

641
00:49:57.967 --> 00:49:59.589
The doors are closing.

642
00:50:04.053 --> 00:50:05.595
What do we do now?

643
00:50:06.346 --> 00:50:07.597
-Hyun-seok. - Yeah?

644
00:50:07.647 --> 00:50:09.149
Is there a control room where

645
00:50:09.189 --> 00:50:11.100
you can see all the building's CCTVs?

646
00:50:11.100 --> 00:50:12.402
What? A control room?

647
00:50:12.732 --> 00:50:14.734
You should know. you're on the security team.

648
00:50:14.734 --> 00:50:15.315
Yeah.

649
00:50:15.315 --> 00:50:18.358
If we can watch all of the CCTVs.

650
00:50:18.448 --> 00:50:21.451
we can see where he's going in real time.

651
00:50:21.951 --> 00:50:23.453
The control room...

652
00:50:24.534 --> 00:50:26.416
is at the very end of Floor B2.

653
00:50:26.416 --> 00:50:27.997
B2! B2!

654
00:50:28.037 --> 00:50:30.870
For now. let's go there and look for Suh.

655
00:50:42.842 --> 00:50:44.133
Alpha. clear.

656
00:50:45.054 --> 00:50:46.386
Delta. clear.

657
00:50:47.187 --> 00:50:49.559
He's set up an entire lab here.

658
00:51:03.243 --> 00:51:05.074
You should see this over here.

659
00:51:21.261 --> 00:51:24.174
What is this? Are they all dead?

660
00:51:24.924 --> 00:51:26.226
They're alive.

661
00:51:33.062 --> 00:51:35.185
What experiment was he doing?

662
00:51:43.283 --> 00:51:45.535
Here! This one's been opened!

663
00:51:48.408 --> 00:51:49.539
Contact!

664
00:52:32.542 --> 00:52:33.833
SPECIAL OPERATION UNIT

665
00:52:40.670 --> 00:52:41.711
Attack!

666
00:52:42.382 --> 00:52:43.553
Return fire!

667
00:52:44.804 --> 00:52:45.715
Alpha down!

668
00:52:54.013 --> 00:52:55.315
Contact!

669
00:52:56.436 --> 00:52:58.398
Take her to safety!

670
00:53:36.896 --> 00:53:39.609
Targets have stopped moving. Clear. confirming.

671
00:53:39.979 --> 00:53:41.401
Clear. confirming.

672
00:53:46.065 --> 00:53:47.407
They've all stopped.

673
00:53:48.158 --> 00:53:49.619
Each defend your own zone.

674
00:53:49.659 --> 00:53:51.951
In case of danger. respond immediately.

675
00:54:39.289 --> 00:54:39.669
What's that?

676
00:54:40.540 --> 00:54:42.081
That's evolving?

677
00:54:43.333 --> 00:54:45.044
Where's the control room?

678
00:54:45.585 --> 00:54:46.626
That way.

679
00:54:46.676 --> 00:54:48.468
Okay. let's move quietly.

680
00:55:55.074 --> 00:55:56.576
Pull yourself together!

681
00:56:17.387 --> 00:56:18.598
Sit me down here.

682
00:56:18.888 --> 00:56:20.180
Close that.

683
00:56:26.396 --> 00:56:28.648
These are the main cameras.

684
00:56:29.279 --> 00:56:30.690
And for the auxiliary cams...

685
00:56:30.730 --> 00:56:31.651
CCTV.

686
00:56:33.783 --> 00:56:35.785
What floor did Suh get off on?

687
00:56:36.156 --> 00:56:37.116
8th floor?

688
00:56:37.447 --> 00:56:39.579
The 9th floor. I'll start looking there.

689
00:56:46.586 --> 00:56:48.708
You're in great shape for your age.

690
00:56:49.299 --> 00:56:51.341
The way you slid back there was so cool.

691
00:56:51.551 --> 00:56:53.002
You were so fast.

692
00:56:53.423 --> 00:56:55.385
How could Suh have known?

693
00:56:56.846 --> 00:56:58.308
The things he said in the elevator.

694
00:56:58.428 --> 00:57:00.430
as if he'd watched what we'd done.

695
00:57:02.602 --> 00:57:03.603
You're right.

696
00:57:04.514 --> 00:57:06.726
Is he watching CCTVs like us?

697
00:57:08.728 --> 00:57:12.652
If Suh can see through the eyes of the infected...

698
00:57:14.154 --> 00:57:15.195
Hold on. then...

699
00:57:16.156 --> 00:57:18.027
Whatever these monsters see.

700
00:57:18.738 --> 00:57:20.490
Suh can see the same thing?

701
00:57:20.700 --> 00:57:22.582
He sees the same thing? What the hell?

702
00:57:22.702 --> 00:57:23.703
I found him!

703
00:57:29.539 --> 00:57:31.421
Where's that bastard going?

704
00:57:55.945 --> 00:57:57.157
What's he doing?

705
00:58:01.661 --> 00:58:03.122
Where is he going?

706
00:58:05.205 --> 00:58:06.876
It seems he's searching for something.

707
00:58:07.377 --> 00:58:08.628
He stopped.

708
00:58:09.209 --> 00:58:10.580
Where is that?

709
00:58:10.920 --> 00:58:15.175
3rd Floor. Building A Hallway...

710
00:58:16.546 --> 00:58:17.677
Bro!

711
00:58:19.679 --> 00:58:22.472
You locked me up. so I had a hard time finding you.

712
00:58:28.438 --> 00:58:29.729
Oh. that's...

713
00:58:29.849 --> 00:58:31.691
CEO Kang Woo-cheol.

714
00:58:31.691 --> 00:58:32.652
Huh?

715
00:58:32.732 --> 00:58:34.814
The first person Suh met.

716
00:58:36.486 --> 00:58:39.569
He was probably the first infected.

717
00:58:46.706 --> 00:58:49.038
See. wasn't I right?

718
00:58:51.621 --> 00:58:54.834
I said you'd be my link to the new humanity.

719
00:58:55.255 --> 00:58:56.756
So hurry up and bite me.

720
00:59:08.137 --> 00:59:09.979
Wait. did he just bite him?

721
00:59:10.690 --> 00:59:11.481
What's happening to him?

722
00:59:26.156 --> 00:59:27.116
Look at them.

723
00:59:45.425 --> 00:59:47.096
I'm not sure what it is.

724
00:59:47.807 --> 00:59:49.389
but they must be receiving some

725
00:59:49.429 --> 00:59:51.271
completely new sort of information.

726
00:59:53.273 --> 00:59:57.187
What is it? Is it connected to Suh being bitten?

727
00:59:57.277 --> 00:59:59.028
I have no idea.

728
00:59:59.819 --> 01:00:02.902
Then how long will they be in this condition?

729
01:00:03.323 --> 01:00:05.155
Before. they were like that for several minutes.

730
01:00:05.155 --> 01:00:06.946
There's no way to know.

731
01:00:08.578 --> 01:00:10.290
Okay. this is our chance.

732
01:00:10.410 --> 01:00:13.203
While they're in that state. we should go get the vaccine.

733
01:00:13.623 --> 01:00:15.875
He's on the 3rd floor. it won't take long.

734
01:00:17.757 --> 01:00:20.420
I'll watch the CCTV from here

735
01:00:20.550 --> 01:00:23.052
and tell you where it's safe. through the group chat.

736
01:00:23.263 --> 01:00:25.715
What you?

737
01:00:27.887 --> 01:00:28.928
You're going to stay here?

738
01:00:28.928 --> 01:00:30.560
Get the vaccine and come back.

739
01:00:30.600 --> 01:00:32.812
Until then. I'll tell you where to go.

740
01:00:33.102 --> 01:00:35.064
How can I leave you behind?

741
01:00:35.645 --> 01:00:38.728
Listen to me. This is the safest way.

742
01:00:39.779 --> 01:00:40.940
Yes. let's do that.

743
01:00:41.030 --> 01:00:43.943
We don't know when they'll wake up. so let's hurry.

744
01:01:34.994 --> 01:01:37.497
Let's drag him to someplace safe.

745
01:01:43.463 --> 01:01:46.466
What's going on?

746
01:01:53.473 --> 01:01:54.394
Go. quick!

747
01:01:55.225 --> 01:01:56.766
Hurry! Run!

748
01:02:03.233 --> 01:02:04.694
Hurry! Get inside!

749
01:02:04.984 --> 01:02:06.025
Hurry!

750
01:02:10.069 --> 01:02:12.031
What is this freak doing?

751
01:02:14.744 --> 01:02:16.626
They're leaving.

752
01:02:47.407 --> 01:02:48.698
Go that way.

753
01:02:54.864 --> 01:02:56.115
This way. quickly!

754
01:03:17.887 --> 01:03:19.138
They're gone.

755
01:03:20.099 --> 01:03:21.771
What the hell did you do?

756
01:03:25.315 --> 01:03:28.988
Ah. did you only pretend to go out? You're smart.

757
01:03:29.899 --> 01:03:31.781
You think if you cover my eyes.

758
01:03:31.781 --> 01:03:34.244
you'll be able to get out of here alive?

759
01:03:34.324 --> 01:03:35.745
What's this freak yammering about?

760
01:03:36.656 --> 01:03:38.618
Since getting bitten by Kang Woo-cheol.

761
01:03:38.658 --> 01:03:40.750
it seems he can communicate with all of them.

762
01:03:41.161 --> 01:03:42.332
Wait. then...

763
01:03:42.792 --> 01:03:46.796
that means he can control all those monsters out there.

764
01:03:48.127 --> 01:03:50.300
Let's only communicate by texting.

765
01:03:50.340 --> 01:03:52.512
Don't let him see or hear anything.

766
01:04:06.606 --> 01:04:09.609
But didn't we file all of our reports already?

767
01:04:10.069 --> 01:04:12.282
Why are they calling us to the Counterterrorism HQ?

768
01:04:12.322 --> 01:04:14.574
We'll see when we get there.

769
01:04:39.138 --> 01:04:41.181
From office go straight to emergency exit.

770
01:04:42.101 --> 01:04:43.143
Up stairs to 4th floor. to machine room.

771
01:04:47.277 --> 01:04:48.438
Let's hurry.

772
01:05:11.631 --> 01:05:12.712
Wait a minute.

773
01:05:14.924 --> 01:05:17.967
We're going back to where we started.

774
01:05:19.058 --> 01:05:20.260
That's right. Why?

775
01:05:21.311 --> 01:05:22.762
We need to pick up my sister.

776
01:05:22.812 --> 01:05:25.975
But now we can get out with the vaccine.

777
01:05:26.316 --> 01:05:27.477
Oh. that's right.

778
01:05:27.727 --> 01:05:30.109
This way. there's an elevator to the roof.

779
01:05:30.270 --> 01:05:31.941
What's going on?

780
01:05:32.021 --> 01:05:32.982
SECURITY

781
01:05:32.982 --> 01:05:34.984
What are you suggesting here?

782
01:05:35.024 --> 01:05:37.157
But now we just need to go up.

783
01:05:37.197 --> 01:05:38.988
You expect us to go back to the control room?

784
01:06:14.364 --> 01:06:17.026
Control Room

785
01:06:32.632 --> 01:06:33.713
What the hell?

786
01:06:33.753 --> 01:06:34.544
Hey!

787
01:06:34.754 --> 01:06:36.716
What do you think you're doing?

788
01:06:37.217 --> 01:06:38.218
-You... What?

789
01:06:38.258 --> 01:06:39.219
What did you do?

790
01:06:39.259 --> 01:06:40.300
Stop it.

791
01:06:40.470 --> 01:06:42.182
Make it fucking stop!

792
01:06:44.184 --> 01:06:45.595
I can't let this bastard go.

793
01:06:45.645 --> 01:06:48.598
I'm taking him with me. You. follow me!

794
01:06:49.479 --> 01:06:50.480
Come on!

795
01:06:50.730 --> 01:06:52.192
What are you doing?

796
01:06:52.312 --> 01:06:53.603
Are you crazy?

797
01:06:54.274 --> 01:06:55.945
Don't touch that vaccine!

798
01:06:59.279 --> 01:07:02.492
I'm sorry. but give up on your sister.

799
01:07:03.323 --> 01:07:04.204
It's too late.

800
01:07:35.064 --> 01:07:37.237
Hyun-seok

801
01:07:40.780 --> 01:07:42.532
Until he brings back his sister.

802
01:07:42.612 --> 01:07:43.993
we're going to wait here.

803
01:07:44.033 --> 01:07:45.245
Got it?

804
01:07:59.339 --> 01:08:00.760
Everyone listen up.

805
01:08:00.920 --> 01:08:04.304
This vaccine here is more important than anyone.

806
01:08:04.724 --> 01:08:06.766
This is for the whole world. okay?

807
01:08:11.931 --> 01:08:15.275
If you want to live. lead the way.

808
01:08:16.396 --> 01:08:17.567
Now!

809
01:08:32.121 --> 01:08:33.373
Hyun-seok!

810
01:08:33.623 --> 01:08:36.045
Are you okay? I'm going to you now.

811
01:08:36.045 --> 01:08:38.798
Which way is safe to go?

812
01:08:40.960 --> 01:08:42.712
Which way should I go?

813
01:08:43.713 --> 01:08:45.054
Hyun-hee!

814
01:08:47.387 --> 01:08:47.767
Um...

815
01:08:48.308 --> 01:08:50.470
Keep going straight ahead.

816
01:08:50.520 --> 01:08:51.971
and turn right.

817
01:08:55.024 --> 01:08:56.105
Okay. then what?

818
01:08:57.777 --> 01:08:59.569
This time. go left.

819
01:09:04.654 --> 01:09:06.576
Go straight. then take the stairs on the right.

820
01:09:06.736 --> 01:09:08.538
No no. stairs on the left!

821
01:09:08.658 --> 01:09:09.579
The left?

822
01:09:09.659 --> 01:09:10.580
Here? Is this right?

823
01:09:10.580 --> 01:09:11.291
Yeah.

824
01:09:11.291 --> 01:09:12.832
Go up those.

825
01:09:14.874 --> 01:09:16.206
Okay. I'm here.

826
01:09:16.456 --> 01:09:18.588
Go out the door and take the elevator.

827
01:09:18.628 --> 01:09:20.420
Here it is!

828
01:09:21.000 --> 01:09:22.091
I'm here!

829
01:09:22.091 --> 01:09:23.343
Are you okay?

830
01:09:27.307 --> 01:09:28.968
Hyun-hee. you made a mistake.

831
