01:36:21.331 --> 01:36:22.542
Did you see that?

1106
01:36:23.463 --> 01:36:25.175
Doesn't she look much better?

1107
01:36:25.795 --> 01:36:27.297
Professor Kwon?

1108
01:36:29.799 --> 01:36:31.631
You sent this invitation. didn't you?

1109
01:36:32.972 --> 01:36:35.725
My inspiration to create these children

1110
01:36:35.725 --> 01:36:37.937
came from you. Professor Kwon.

1111
01:36:41.391 --> 01:36:44.394
My dad begged you.

1112
01:36:49.149 --> 01:36:50.610
To Prof. Kwon: Imperfect communication.

1113
01:36:50.650 --> 01:36:51.611
the source of all tragedy

1114
01:36:51.611 --> 01:36:53.453
Se-jeong. this is a misunderstanding.

1115
01:36:53.533 --> 01:36:56.156
The law doesn't always match the actual situation.

1116
01:36:56.786 --> 01:36:59.289
Borrowing the name of students who didn't take part

1117
01:36:59.459 --> 01:37:02.712
was the only way to pay students who did participate.

1118
01:37:02.962 --> 01:37:04.714
They all agreed to it.

1119
01:37:04.964 --> 01:37:07.337
No. no. Se-jeong...

1120
01:37:07.337 --> 01:37:11.261
This is a tragedy resulting from imperfect communication.

1121
01:37:12.342 --> 01:37:13.383
No. please.

1122
01:37:13.723 --> 01:37:15.134
Se-jeong... Se-jeong?

1123
01:37:29.989 --> 01:37:33.193
And so. all of this was because of that incident?

1124
01:37:34.494 --> 01:37:36.746
If you want revenge. take it out on me. asshole!

1125
01:37:37.697 --> 01:37:38.908
What
What revenge?

1126
01:37:40.250 --> 01:37:42.202
My dad's death

1127
01:37:44.204 --> 01:37:47.126
was a tragedy caused by imperfect communication.

1128
01:37:47.707 --> 01:37:49.839
Not because of someone like you.

1129
01:37:49.839 --> 01:37:53.303
Like you... like you...

1130
01:37:55.385 --> 01:37:58.017
Compared to the great achievements of mankind.

1131
01:37:58.178 --> 01:37:59.349
the knowledge possessed

1132
01:37:59.349 --> 01:38:01.431
by any individual is incredibly limited.

1133
01:38:02.021 --> 01:38:06.686
That limitation creates a state of terrible incomprehension.

1134
01:38:07.727 --> 01:38:10.570
In the end. the way to stop all such tragedies

1135
01:38:10.940 --> 01:38:15.285
is to connect all of our minds together.

1136
01:38:16.866 --> 01:38:19.369
The imperfect communication of human beings.

1137
01:38:19.739 --> 01:38:21.581
all the tragedies that result from

1138
01:38:21.621 --> 01:38:23.873
not fully understanding what others feel.

1139
01:38:24.624 --> 01:38:26.876
This system is the perfect solution.

1140
01:38:27.957 --> 01:38:29.959
That's what we are.

1141
01:38:32.172 --> 01:38:36.346
What do less evolved beings like you have over us?

1142
01:38:37.347 --> 01:38:38.468
Ah ...

1143
01:38:39.309 --> 01:38:41.351
The freedom to be an outcast?

1144
01:38:42.932 --> 01:38:45.064
Can you handle that. Professor?

1145
01:38:46.646 --> 01:38:48.728
You do this because you can handle it?

1146
01:38:49.899 --> 01:38:52.111
Then go ahead. be an outcast.

1147
01:39:02.782 --> 01:39:04.414
Alpha Team. target located.

1148
01:39:16.256 --> 01:39:18.508
Alpha Team. vaccine secured! Vaccine secured!

1149
01:39:18.798 --> 01:39:20.760
If target's secured. withdraw quickly!

1150
01:39:52.212 --> 01:39:55.635
Well. it's a shame. but at least we've got the vaccine...

1151
01:39:58.007 --> 01:39:59.549
Then what about her?

1152
01:40:00.089 --> 01:40:02.051
You're just going to abandon her?

1153
01:40:02.472 --> 01:40:04.804
Send the rescue team back in now!

1154
01:40:05.265 --> 01:40:06.726
Okay. everyone...

1155
01:40:06.846 --> 01:40:08.898
Professor. get some rest. okay?

1156
01:40:09.149 --> 01:40:10.940
think your job here is done.

1157
01:40:11.151 --> 01:40:13.603
Escort the professor out. Back to your places.

1158
01:40:13.693 --> 01:40:15.525
- This way. please. - Let go!

1159
01:40:18.107 --> 01:40:20.320
Alpha Team moving to Building C Rooftop.

1160
01:40:20.320 --> 01:40:23.032
Roger. Charlie Team ready to move to adjacent building.

1161
01:40:39.008 --> 01:40:42.182
My Better Half

1162
01:40:46.306 --> 01:40:47.597
Hello?

1163
01:40:47.807 --> 01:40:51.271
Hello? Professor Kwon? Are you okay?

1164
01:40:52.482 --> 01:40:55.104
I know your situation there.

1165
01:40:55.445 --> 01:40:57.026
You know my situation?

1166
01:40:57.897 --> 01:41:01.821
I was watching from the Counterterrorism HQ.

1167
01:41:02.742 --> 01:41:03.823
I'm sorry.

1168
01:41:04.364 --> 01:41:07.327
I don't think the rescue team can go back.

1169
01:41:10.210 --> 01:41:12.912
Then why are you calling me?

1170
01:41:15.375 --> 01:41:18.127
I thought I had found a way to stop the infected.

1171
01:41:18.718 --> 01:41:22.051
There was a group of monkeys Suh experimented on at his lab.

1172
01:41:22.222 --> 01:41:24.844
When a monkey marked

1173
01:41:25.014 --> 01:41:27.557
all the other monkeys stopped moving.

1174
01:41:27.677 --> 01:41:28.678
They stopped moving?

1175
01:41:29.269 --> 01:41:31.681
So I thought killing the first infected

1176
01:41:31.681 --> 01:41:33.313
would solve everything...

1177
01:41:41.281 --> 01:41:42.992
The monkey marked

1178
01:41:43.193 --> 01:41:45.325
It's not the first one to be infected.

1179
01:41:45.575 --> 01:41:47.787
It's the monkey that controls all the others.

1180
01:41:47.947 --> 01:41:50.200
In that case. monkey

1181
01:41:51.201 --> 01:41:52.952
Suh Young-chul himself.

1182
01:41:53.543 --> 01:41:55.875
Alpha Team arriving at destination.

1183
01:41:56.085 --> 01:41:57.707
Have you ever been shot?

1184
01:41:58.548 --> 01:41:59.709
Eyes forward.

1185
01:42:21.481 --> 01:42:23.153
I'm so sore.

1186
01:42:44.754 --> 01:42:46.556
Tell them to kill Suh Young-chul immediately.

1187
01:42:46.556 --> 01:42:49.179
That'll stop all of them from moving.

1188
01:42:49.599 --> 01:42:51.971
If Suh gets outside. we're finished!

1189
01:42:52.972 --> 01:42:55.895
We can't. If we kill him now.

1190
01:42:56.266 --> 01:42:58.358
not only the victims' families.

1191
01:42:58.728 --> 01:43:00.900
but everyone scared of getting infected

1192
01:43:00.900 --> 01:43:02.272
will become our enemies.

1193
01:43:02.322 --> 01:43:04.774
The government won't easily make that decision.

1194
01:43:05.865 --> 01:43:07.697
Can you handle that?

1195
01:43:08.198 --> 01:43:10.580
Then go ahead. be an outcast.

1196
01:43:12.622 --> 01:43:14.284
So that's what he meant.

1197
01:43:30.180 --> 01:43:32.011
Is he really the vaccine?

1198
01:43:32.972 --> 01:43:36.266
Never mind what others think. what do you think?

1199
01:43:39.058 --> 01:43:40.940
You have to decide.

1200
01:43:56.706 --> 01:43:59.459
Any issues bringing Suh Young-chul outside?

1201
01:43:59.879 --> 01:44:02.922
No. Suh Young-chul is coming out safely.

1202
01:44:11.971 --> 01:44:13.683
We need to eliminate Suh Young-chul!

1203
01:44:14.554 --> 01:44:15.975
What are you talking about?

1204
01:44:16.226 --> 01:44:18.478
I called Professor Kwon who's in the building now.

1205
01:44:18.648 --> 01:44:21.811
and she said Suh is controlling all of the infected.

1206
01:44:21.811 --> 01:44:22.902
Suh Young-chul is

1207
01:44:22.982 --> 01:44:24.524
We need to kill him.

1208
01:44:24.984 --> 01:44:27.607
Seriously? Kill the vaccine?

1209
01:44:29.359 --> 01:44:30.990
Your responsibility extends only

1210
01:44:31.030 --> 01:44:33.032
to that operation that failed earlier!

1211
01:44:33.323 --> 01:44:35.285
Does anyone have clear evidence

1212
01:44:35.285 --> 01:44:37.577
that we need to kill our only vaccine?

1213
01:44:37.617 --> 01:44:39.078
Anyone? Anyone have it?

1214
01:44:41.501 --> 01:44:45.425
The vaccine is on his way here now. It's all finished!

1215
01:44:47.967 --> 01:44:50.880
HQ. lifting lockdown here. One SWAT vehicle moving.

1216
01:44:50.880 --> 01:44:52.722
The vaccine is being moved to the safe zone.

1217
01:44:54.013 --> 01:44:56.886
HQ. vehicle has entered! I repeat. vehicle has entered!

1218
01:45:03.893 --> 01:45:05.525
Too many people are gathered in front

1219
01:45:05.565 --> 01:45:07.357
of Doongwoori Building. Support needed.

1220
01:45:07.697 --> 01:45:09.399
Requesting all available personnel

1221
01:45:09.399 --> 01:45:11.201
to be sent to Doongwoori Building.

1222
01:47:06.146 --> 01:47:08.518
Secure the area! Move back!

1223
01:47:09.068 --> 01:47:10.690
Stop. please. Move back.

1224
01:47:10.820 --> 01:47:12.442
Move back. move back!

1225
01:47:46.976 --> 01:47:48.518
Minister!

1226
01:47:54.113 --> 01:47:55.365
The barricade in front of

1227
01:47:55.365 --> 01:47:57.317
Doongwoori Building is being breached!

1228
01:47:57.567 --> 01:47:58.778
What?

1229
01:48:25.725 --> 01:48:26.976
Come on.

1230
01:48:33.653 --> 01:48:36.356
No... we need to get Suh.

1231
01:48:36.486 --> 01:48:38.278
Where are the nearest army units?

1232
01:48:39.028 --> 01:48:42.822
All the troops in Seoul are mobilized in there.

1233
01:48:44.324 --> 01:48:45.415
Damn it!

1234
01:48:45.665 --> 01:48:48.918
Listen. everyone. Let's disband for now. okay?

1235
01:48:48.958 --> 01:48:51.461
We'll decide the HQ's new location later.

1236
01:48:51.501 --> 01:48:53.333
Everyone evacuate. quickly!

1237
01:49:33.413 --> 01:49:34.504
Hello?

1238
01:49:34.834 --> 01:49:36.666
What happened to Suh?

1239
01:49:37.377 --> 01:49:39.759
The people in charge here are all running away.

1240
01:49:40.009 --> 01:49:41.761
And Suh Young-chul escaped.

1241
01:49:43.343 --> 01:49:46.386
Can you check Suh's location? You said you saw everything.

1242
01:49:46.476 --> 01:49:48.888
Just a minute. I'll call you right back.

1243
01:49:50.230 --> 01:49:51.391
Professor Gong.

1244
01:49:52.101 --> 01:49:53.313
Professor Gong!

1245
01:50:04.113 --> 01:50:05.575
Do we know Suh's location?

1246
01:50:05.615 --> 01:50:06.536
What?

1247
01:50:06.866 --> 01:50:08.288
What are you doing?

1248
01:50:08.578 --> 01:50:09.659
You need to evacuate!

1249
01:50:09.909 --> 01:50:11.661
There's no time! Go. quickly!

1250
01:50:24.264 --> 01:50:25.465
I found him.

1251
01:50:26.346 --> 01:50:28.308
He's at 32 Sinsok Street. on the main road.

1252
01:50:31.971 --> 01:50:33.813
See the car with blinking lights?

1253
01:50:34.274 --> 01:50:35.225
see it.

1254
01:50:35.275 --> 01:50:36.436
I'm watching.

1255
01:50:39.399 --> 01:50:41.070
Tell me which way to go.

1256
01:50:48.238 --> 01:50:49.409
Keep going straight.

1257
01:50:49.409 --> 01:50:49.949
Keep going straight. Jalan terus

1258
01:50:51.911 --> 01:50:53.493
Left at the intersection.

1259
01:50:59.459 --> 01:51:00.840
Turn right at the next intersection.

1260
01:53:09.629 --> 01:53:11.511
That idiot. covering himself in that...

1261
01:53:18.888 --> 01:53:19.979
Move!

1262
01:53:22.522 --> 01:53:24.604
Out of the way!

1263
01:53:50.590 --> 01:53:51.841
reverted to their original state.

1264
01:54:38.518 --> 01:54:40.600
Stop! Stop. you bastards!

1265
01:54:41.221 --> 01:54:42.562
Stop!

1266
01:54:55.405 --> 01:54:57.447
Please stop!

1267
01:55:03.703 --> 01:55:04.544
Stop!

1268
01:55:04.914 --> 01:55:06.085
Please...

1269
01:56:54.774 --> 01:56:55.445
Yes?

1270
01:56:55.445 --> 01:56:57.697
How's it in other places? Was it successful?

1271
01:57:00.780 --> 01:57:02.362
They've stopped.

1272
01:57:03.823 --> 01:57:05.495
You did it.

1273
01:57:06.496 --> 01:57:09.249
I doubt people will see it that way.

1274
01:57:10.119 --> 01:57:11.581
What should we do?

1275
01:57:11.751 --> 01:57:13.923
The vaccine's gone for good now.

1276
01:57:13.923 --> 01:57:15.965
Everyone's going to hate me.

1277
01:57:17.337 --> 01:57:18.718
Don't worry.

1278
01:57:18.838 --> 01:57:21.341
I'll testify with you.

1279
01:57:21.841 --> 01:57:25.134
If you're going to be hated. I'll take it with you.

1280
01:57:30.940 --> 01:57:32.772
No need for that.

1281
01:57:32.942 --> 01:57:34.694
I'm used to people hating me.

1282
01:57:36.736 --> 01:57:38.448
Where are you now?

1283
01:57:39.739 --> 01:57:42.322
I guess we have a lot of work ahead of us.

1284
01:57:43.305 --> 01:58:43.211
Do you want subtitles for any video?
